  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n ilk b\xF6l\xFCmlerinde b\xFCt\xFCnle\u015Fmi\u015F bir k\u0131s\u0131m
    telveler, t\u0131pk\u0131 bir \u015Fad\u0131rvan\u0131 and\u0131r\u0131yor. Oradaki
    \xE7e\u015Fmenin \xF6n\xFCnde k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir tabureye oturmu\u015F, adeta
    abdest al\u0131yorsun {{isim}}. \u0130nan\xE7l\u0131 biri misindir de\u011Fil
    misindir bilemem; ancak bu yans\u0131malar, \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    i\u015Fe dair ya da maddiyata dair korkular\u0131ndan emin olman gerekti\u011Fine
    i\u015Faret. A\xE7\u0131k bir koruma alt\u0131ndas\u0131n.\n\nHemen yan k\u0131s\u0131mda
    g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm baz\u0131 tortular, pembe a\xE7elya yapraklar\u0131n\u0131
    and\u0131r\u0131yor. \u0130\xE7lerine g\xF6m\xFCl\xFC bir de \"{{sabit_sayi,4,19}}\"
    say\u0131s\u0131 var. Bug\xFCnden itibaren {{sabit_sayi,4,19}} g\xFCn say. Kar\u015F\u0131na
    \xE7\u0131kan o g\xFCnde biriyle yapaca\u011F\u0131n sohbetten b\xFCy\xFCk keyif
    alacaks\u0131n."
